# Merchant Ship put onto the battlefield attacking by Kinscaer Sentry gains life if unblocked, even though it was not declared as an attacker (CR 508.4, 509.1h).
[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Kinscaer Sentry
Merchant Ship
Plains x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
